---
layout: base.njk
pagination:
  data: airports
  size: 1
  alias: airport
permalink: "/{{ airport.state | lower }}/{{ airport.citySlug }}/"
eleventyComputed:
  title: "Official and off-airport parking at {{ airport.airportCode }} · {{ site.name }}"
  description: "Official {{ airport.airportCode }} parking lots with published daily rates, plus verified off-airport shuttle lots and hotel park-and-fly options. Rates are labeled with the date we copied them. We do not cache live prices or open spots."
  ogType: "article"
  extraJs: "/assets/filters.js"
  breadcrumbs:
    - name: Home
      url: /
    - name: "{{ airport.airportCode }}"
      url: "/{{ airport.state | lower }}/{{ airport.citySlug }}/"
---
{% set faqs = airport.faqs if airport.faqs else (airport | defaultAirportFaqs) %}

<article class="city-page">
  <header class="page-hero wrap">
    {% include "partials/breadcrumbs.njk" %}
    <p class="eyebrow">{{ airport.airportName }} · {{ airport.city }}, {{ airport.state }}</p>
    <h1>Parking at {{ airport.airportCode }} when official lots are full or expensive</h1>
    <p class="lede">{{ airport.intro }}</p>
    <p class="meta">{{ airport.officialLots | length }} official lots · {{ airport.listings | length }} off-airport listings · Last updated {{ airport.lastUpdated | displayDate }}</p>
  </header>

  <section class="wrap" id="official-lots" aria-labelledby="official-heading">
    <div class="section-head">
      <h2 id="official-heading">Official on-airport lots</h2>
      <p class="muted">Rates below are copied from the airport’s public parking page and labeled with the date we checked. They are not live quotes. Prebooked rates can differ from drive-up rates, and both can change.</p>
    </div>
    {% if airport.officialBookingUrl %}
    <p><a class="button" href="{{ airport.officialBookingUrl }}" rel="noopener">Official {{ airport.airportCode }} parking reservation page</a></p>
    {% endif %}
    <div class="table-scroll">
      <table class="listing-table">
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th scope="col">Lot</th>
            <th scope="col">Published daily rate</th>
            <th scope="col">Access</th>
            <th scope="col">Notes</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          {% for lot in airport.officialLots %}
          <tr id="{{ lot.name | slugifyId }}">
            <td>
              <span class="listing-name">{{ lot.name }}</span>
              <p class="small muted">Official airport lot</p>
              {% if lot.address %}<p class="small muted">{{ lot.address }}</p>{% endif %}
              {% if lot.area %}<p class="small muted">{{ lot.area }}</p>{% endif %}
              <p class="small muted">Last checked {{ lot.lastChecked | displayDate }} · {% for source in lot.sources %}<a href="{{ source.url }}" rel="noopener">{{ source.label }}</a>{% if not loop.last %}, {% endif %}{% endfor %}</p>
            </td>
            <td>
              {% if lot.driveUpDailyMax %}<p>Drive-up: {{ lot.driveUpDailyMax | rateAsListed(lot.rateAsOf) }}</p>{% endif %}
              {% if lot.prebookRate %}<p>Prebook: {{ lot.prebookRate | rateAsListed(lot.rateAsOf) }}</p>{% endif %}
              {% if lot.hourlyOrIncrement %}<p class="small muted">{{ lot.hourlyOrIncrement }}</p>{% endif %}
              {% if lot.rateNotes %}<p class="small muted">{{ lot.rateNotes }}</p>{% endif %}
            </td>
            <td>
              {% if lot.access %}<p>{{ lot.access }}</p>{% endif %}
              {% if lot.hours %}<p class="small muted">{{ lot.hours | hoursSummary }}</p>{% endif %}
              {% if lot.hours.notes %}<p class="small muted">{{ lot.hours.notes }}</p>{% endif %}
            </td>
            <td>
              {% if lot.heightRestriction %}<p>Height: {{ lot.heightRestriction }}</p>{% endif %}
              {% if lot.reservationRequired %}<p>Reservation required</p>{% endif %}
              {% if lot.visitNotes %}<p class="small muted">{{ lot.visitNotes }}</p>{% endif %}
              {% if lot.bookingUrl %}<p><a href="{{ lot.bookingUrl }}" rel="noopener">Official booking or lot page</a></p>{% endif %}
            </td>
          </tr>
          {% endfor %}
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="wrap" id="listings" aria-labelledby="listings-heading">
    <div class="section-head">
      <h2 id="listings-heading">Off-airport lots and hotel park-and-fly</h2>
      <p class="muted">Filter by what the operator itself publishes. A shuttle flag is not a guarantee of wait time today. Booking links go to the operator’s own site.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="filters" data-filter-bar>
      <p class="filter-label" id="filter-label">Show only:</p>
      <div class="filter-toggles" role="group" aria-labelledby="filter-label">
        <button type="button" class="chip" data-filter="shuttle" aria-pressed="false">Shuttle</button>
        <button type="button" class="chip" data-filter="covered" aria-pressed="false">Covered</button>
        <button type="button" class="chip" data-filter="valet" aria-pressed="false">Valet</button>
        <button type="button" class="chip" data-filter="open24hours" aria-pressed="false">Open 24 hours</button>
        <button type="button" class="chip" data-filter="hotelparkandfly" aria-pressed="false">Hotel park-and-fly</button>
      </div>
      <p class="filter-count" data-filter-count></p>
    </div>

    <div class="table-scroll">
      <table class="listing-table">
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th scope="col">Lot</th>
            <th scope="col">Address</th>
            <th scope="col">Hours &amp; shuttle</th>
            <th scope="col">What they offer</th>
            <th scope="col">Book</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          {% for listing in airport.listings %}
          <tr
            id="{{ listing.name | slugifyId }}"
            class="listing-row"
            data-shuttle="{{ '1' if listing.flags.shuttle else '0' }}"
            data-covered="{{ '1' if listing.flags.covered else '0' }}"
            data-valet="{{ '1' if listing.flags.valet else '0' }}"
            data-open24hours="{{ '1' if listing.flags.open24Hours else '0' }}"
            data-hotelparkandfly="{{ '1' if listing.flags.hotelParkAndFly else '0' }}"
          >
            <td>
              {% if listing.website %}
              <a class="listing-name" href="{{ listing.website }}" rel="noopener">{{ listing.name }}</a>
              {% else %}
              <span class="listing-name">{{ listing.name }}</span>
              {% endif %}
              <p class="small muted">{% if listing.category == "hotel" %}Hotel park-and-fly{% else %}Off-airport lot{% endif %}{% if listing.flags.authorizedOffAirport %} · Listed by the airport as an authorized off-airport option{% endif %}</p>
              {% if listing.feeNotes %}<p class="small muted">{{ listing.feeNotes }}</p>{% endif %}
              <p class="small muted">Last checked {{ listing.lastChecked | displayDate }} · {% for source in listing.sources %}<a href="{{ source.url }}" rel="noopener">{{ source.label }}</a>{% if not loop.last %}, {% endif %}{% endfor %}</p>
            </td>
            <td>
              <p>{{ listing.area }}</p>
              {% if listing.address %}<p class="small muted">{{ listing.address }}</p>{% endif %}
              {% if listing.visitNotes %}<p class="small muted">{{ listing.visitNotes }}</p>{% endif %}
            </td>
            <td>
              <p>{{ listing.hours | hoursSummary }}</p>
              {% if listing.hours.notes %}<p class="small muted">{{ listing.hours.notes }}</p>{% endif %}
              {% if listing.shuttle %}<p>{{ listing.shuttle }}</p>{% endif %}
            </td>
            <td>
              <p>{{ listing.offers | joinList }}</p>
              {% if listing.offersNotes %}<p class="small muted">{{ listing.offersNotes }}</p>{% endif %}
              <ul class="flags">
                {% if listing.flags.shuttle %}<li>Shuttle</li>{% endif %}
                {% if listing.flags.covered %}<li>Covered</li>{% endif %}
                {% if listing.flags.valet %}<li>Valet</li>{% endif %}
                {% if listing.flags.open24Hours %}<li>Open 24 hours</li>{% endif %}
                {% if listing.flags.hotelParkAndFly %}<li>Hotel park-and-fly</li>{% endif %}
                {% if listing.flags.evCharging %}<li>EV charging</li>{% endif %}
              </ul>
            </td>
            <td>
              {% if listing.phone %}<p><a href="{{ listing.phone | telHref }}">{{ listing.phone }}</a></p>{% endif %}
              {% if listing.bookingUrl %}<p><a href="{{ listing.bookingUrl }}" rel="noopener">Operator booking page</a></p>{% endif %}
            </td>
          </tr>
          {% endfor %}
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
    <p class="empty-filter" data-empty-filter hidden>No listings on this page match those filters. Clear a filter, or read the <a href="/guides/airport-parking-full-what-to-do-and-where-to-park-instead/">sold-out parking guide</a>.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="wrap tonight" id="if-the-lot-is-full" aria-labelledby="how-to-heading">
    <h2 id="how-to-heading">If the official lot is full</h2>
    <ol class="steps">
      <li>Check the airport’s official reservation page first. Some official lots still take online bookings when drive-up spaces are gone{% if airport.officialBookingUrl %} (<a href="{{ airport.officialBookingUrl }}" rel="noopener">{{ airport.airportCode }} official reservations</a>){% endif %}.</li>
      <li>Compare an off-airport shuttle lot on this page. Confirm the address, shuttle pickup point, and hours on the operator’s own site before you drive over.</li>
      <li>If you also need a hotel night, look at a park-and-fly package the hotel itself publishes. Those offers usually require a stay.</li>
      <li>For a broader plan, read the <a href="/guides/airport-parking-full-what-to-do-and-where-to-park-instead/">sold-out parking guide</a>.</li>
    </ol>
  </section>

  <div class="wrap">
    {% include "partials/affiliate.njk" %}
  </div>

  <section class="wrap more-cities" aria-labelledby="more-heading">
    <h2 id="more-heading">Other airports and the sold-out guide</h2>
    <ul class="internal-links">
      {% for other in airports %}
      {% if other.slug != airport.slug %}
      <li><a href="{{ other | airportPath }}">Parking at {{ other.airportCode }} ({{ other.city }}, {{ other.state }})</a> ({{ other.officialLots | length }} official lots, {{ other.listings | length }} off-airport listings)</li>
      {% endif %}
      {% endfor %}
      <li><a href="/guides/airport-parking-full-what-to-do-and-where-to-park-instead/">Airport parking full? What to do and where to park instead</a></li>
      <li><a href="/">All airports</a></li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="wrap faq" id="faq" aria-labelledby="faq-heading">
    <h2 id="faq-heading">Frequently asked questions</h2>
    {% for faq in faqs %}
    <details>
      <summary>{{ faq.q }}</summary>
      <p>{{ faq.a }}</p>
    </details>
    {% endfor %}
  </section>
</article>
